      <MissionDesc>Pangea Foundation's mission is to provide technical capacity building services to nonprofit organizations, primarily through training and support for low income housing communities. Our capacity building services help low income housing providers implement, manage, monitor and evaluate their health and social services programs.</MissionDesc>
